---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Legal notice: publisher of the German family law calculators" description="Legal notice (Impressum) under section 5 DDG: who publishes the support, divorce cost, garnishment and inheritance calculators, who is responsible and who hosts them." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Mandatory information under section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (DDG) for {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <h2>Responsible for content (section 18(2) MStV)</h2>
    <p>{AUTHOR_NAME}, address as above, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>What this site is and is not</h2>
    <p>The site calculates child, spousal and parental maintenance under the Düsseldorf Table, divorce costs under the court and lawyer fee acts, garnishable income under section 850c of the Code of Civil Procedure, and inheritance shares, compulsory shares and inheritance tax. It is independent: it belongs to no court, youth welfare office, law firm or debt advice service and refers no clients. Every result is a general calculation for typical circumstances, not a legal service under the German Legal Services Act. Only court orders, official decisions and the statutes in force are binding. The calculation paths are set out in the <a href={route('method', lang)}>calculation method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Liability</h2>
    <p>We reconcile the values after every new table or change in the law and test the calculators against the official tables before each release; we nonetheless give no guarantee that they are free of errors. Providers of linked external content are responsible for it. Please report mistakes through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Embedding</h2>
    <p>The child support and garnishment calculators may be embedded free of charge by iframe as long as the source link stays visible: <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed a calculator</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Consumer dispute resolution</h2>
    <p>We are neither willing nor obliged to take part in dispute resolution before a consumer arbitration board. On data protection see the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a>. Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
